ission\",\"when\":\"the screen is shown\",\"then\":\"an on-screen rationale state with a re-request button is displayed and the app does not crash\"},\n    {\"id\":\"AS3\",\"given\":\"a selfie has been captured and the Style screen is shown\",\"when\":\"the user selects a different filter chip\",\"then\":\"the live preview updates immediately to reflect the selected ColorMatrix\"},\n    {\"id\":\"AS4\",\"given\":\"the project sources\",\"when\":\"gradlew assembleDebug is run\",\"then\":\"the build finishes with BUILD SUCCESSFUL and produces an installable debug APK with no INTERNET permission in the merged manifest\"}\n  ],\n  \"checks\": \"gradlew assembleDebug returns BUILD SUCCESSFUL; gradlew test runs the JVM ColorMatrix unit tests green; merged AndroidManifest contains CAMERA and does NOT contain INTERNET; the produced debug APK file exists.\",\n  \"risk\": \"Dependency-version conflicts between Compose/Navigation/CameraX/lifecycle can break the build (mitigated by a central version catalog, Compose BOM, single pinned CameraX 1.4.0 and lifecycle 2.8.x); in-memory Bitmap is lost on process death (accepted MVP limitation); pure-Kotlin per-pixel filter is O(pixels) but acceptable for a single selfie.\",\n  \"parallel_policy\": {\n    \"mode\": \"chapter-waves\",\n    \"rationale\": \"Chapter 1 (Gradle scaffold + green build) is a hard barrier all other work depends on; after it the filters/camera/save chapters touch disjoint files and run as one parallel wave; screen integration and final APK are serial.\",\n    \"barrier\": \"after Chapter 1 green assembleDebug\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Каркас Gradle (Kotlin DSL + version catalog).** Зафиксированные версии в `gradle/libs.versions.toml`:\n```\n[versions]\nagp = \"8.7.2\"\nkotlin = \"2.0.21\"\ncoreKtx = \"1.13.1\"\nlifecycle = \"2.8.7\"\nactivityCompose = \"1.9.3\"\ncomposeBom = \"2024.09.03\"\nnavigationCompose = \"2.8.4\"\ncamerax = \"1.4.0\"\njunit = \"4.13.2\"\n```\nСоздай: `settings.gradle.kts` (pluginManagement 